WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
What did you do on Sunday?

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:04.850
I went to the park with a friend.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.214
Did you play football?

00:00:07.464 --> 00:00:10.725
No, it rained. We had a coffee.

00:00:10.975 --> 00:00:13.720
And afterwards, I went home.
